制好的鸡丁至变色散开（约十秒钟），然后盛出。;6. 爆香: 锅中保留底油烧热，加入干辣椒和5克花椒炒至变为棕红色并释放香气，接着加入姜末、蒜末和葱白，炒香。;7. 混合烹炒: 将炒好的鸡丁重新放入锅中翻炒，加入胡萝卜丁和黄瓜丁翻炒片刻，然后倒入调好的宫保酱汁，用中大火翻炒均匀至汁液略干。;8. 出锅: 最后加入炸好的花生米和葱段，翻炒均匀即可出锅。\",\"ingredients\":\"undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: ;undefined: undefined undefined , is_optional: \"}]}}}"}
