和加工肉制品则比较少。它强调简单、天然、新鲜的烹饪方式，善用香草和香料调味。\\n\\n这种饮食方式被认为是全球最健康的饮食之一，对体重管理、心脑血管健康、癌症和糖尿病预防都有很多好处呢！而且，它不仅仅是关于吃什么，更是一种生活方式，提倡和家人朋友一起享受美食，定期运动，还可以适量饮用葡萄酒。\",\"responseType\":\"COMPLETION\"},\"providerOptions\":{\"google\":{\"thoughtSignature\":\"\"}}}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool-result\",\"toolCallId\":\"B5I25P0a7rFguzL8\",\"toolName\":\"system_replyToUser\",\"output\":{\"type\":\"json\",\"value\":{}}}]}]},\"providerMetadata\":{\"google\":{\"promptFeedback\":null,\"groundingMetadata\":null,\"urlContextMetadata\":null,\"safetyRatings\":null,\"usageMetadata\":{\"thoughtsTokenCount\":67,\"promptTokenCount\":1798,\"candidatesTokenCount\":172,\"totalTokenCount\":2037}},\"gateway\":{\"routing\":{\"originalModelId\":\"google/gemini-2.5-flash\",\"resolvedProvider\":\"vertex\",\"resolvedProviderApiModelId\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\",\"internalResolvedModelId\":\"vertex:gemini-2.5-flash\",\"fallbacksAvailable\":[\"google\"],\"internalReasoning\":\"Selected vertex as preferred provider for gemini-2.5-flash. 1 fallback(s) available: google\",\"planningReasoning\":\"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)\",\"canonicalSlug\":\"google/gemini-2.5-flash\",\"finalProvider\":\"vertex\",\"attempts\":[{\"provider\":\"vertex\",\"internalModelId\":\"vertex:gemini-2.5-flash\",\"providerApiModelId\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\",\"credentialType\":\"system\",\"success\":true,\"startTime\":6044959.566226,\"endTime\":6046626.262041,\"statusCode\":200}],\"modelAttemptCount\":1,\"modelAttempts\":[{\"modelId\":\"google/gemini-2.5-flash\",\"canonicalSlug\":\"google/gemini-2.5-flash\",\"success\":true,\"providerAttemptCount\":1,\"providerAttempts\":[{\"provider\":\"vertex\",\"internalModelId\":\"vertex:gemini-2.5-flash\",\"providerApiModelId\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\",\"credentialType\":\"system\",\"success\":true,\"startTime\":6044959.566226,\"endTime\":6046626.262041,\"statusCode\":200}]}],\"totalProviderAttemptCount\":1},\"cost\":\"0